app_id":881940,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-881940-1846651706689688","game_id":"steam-881940","kind":"update","title":"Demo Language Update #4 v0.2.00","summary":"LANGUAGE UPDATE We have past the 200,000 wishlists mark which puts us in the top 250 of most anticipated games...🤯This is nuts🤯We are very thankful for your enthutiasm! Although we're only a small team working on our free time, we want to make sure the final experience will be well-designed and polished, from start to finish, hence the longer development cycle. We know the trend goes more towards fastly shipped, cheaper games but we prefer to take our time to craft something we really enjoy!Mean","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T10:51:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689688","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-881940-1839676055895316","game_id":"steam-881940","kind":"update","title":"Quick demo patch #3 v0.1.13","summary":"We reached the incredible milestone of... 🤩100,000 WISHLISTS😭An immense thank you for your support and enthutiasm. We are very much grateful and excited to get back working on the full game. Here is probably the last demo patch we'll do before a while. We want to focus on the actual game development. This week we'll dive into implementing the new ideas we have for weapons ascension as well as passive and active spells. This will make the endgame incredibly juicy and rewarding, while facing thous","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-03T16:46:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055895316","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-881940-1839041357036699","game_id":"steam-881940","kind":"update","title":"Quick demo patch #2, v0.1.12","summary":"Another quick patch to adress the main complaint we got: ADS mod being glitched! Max fixed the issue where you where stuck in ADS mode (aiming mode) sometimes. Many thanks to the user who found the bug reproduction! It helped us greatly. Flo also made a couple of changes:The issue where you could be stuck on a jar is normally fixedWe made the door fully automatic as it was either anoying to use, or too easy to cheeze enemy with the dagger. We think it's best to be in the melee when using dagger!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-27T20:34:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357036699","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-881940-1839041357032332","game_id":"steam-881940","kind":"update","title":"Quick demo patch v 0.1.11","summary":"Thanks everybody for all your great feedback and bug report on the demo!Most of you seems to be having a lot of fun, that is awesome news and gives us strength to carry on. We received a tons of people being stuck in ADS, sorry about that, it's really hard to track down and fix. We have made a first attempt but it doesn't fix all instances of the bug, we'll keep digging.﻿CHANGE LOGFallback fonts for cyrlic and asian languagesBetter Shockwave impact on enemiesBUGFixed ADS locked after dying or op","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-25T16:50:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357032332","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_r